title: "Add `slash_submission_deposit` extrinsic to pallet-referenda"
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |
    Adds a new extrinsic `slash_submission_deposit` to `pallet-referenda` that allows slashing
    the submission deposit for referenda that have been `Rejected` or `TimedOut`.

    This complements the existing `refund_submission_deposit` which only works for `Approved`
    or `Cancelled` referenda.
- audience: Runtime User
  description: |
    A new permissionless `slash_submission_deposit` call allows any signed account to slash the
    submission deposit of a referendum that has been rejected or timed out.
    
    The deposit is removed from the submitter's reserved balance and a `DepositSlashed` event
    is emitted.

crates:
- name: pallet-referenda
  bump: major
- name: rococo-runtime
  bump: major
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: major
- name: collectives-westend-runtime
  bump: major
